flowchart TD
    START([input_start]) --> RI[receive_input]
    RI --> LS[load_session_state]
    LS --> CPC[check_pending_clarification]
    CPC -->|new topic / normal input| BI[basic_input_validate]
    CPC -->|pending reply digits| TR[target_resolve]
    CPC -->|expired / invalid pending reply| CL[clarify_response]

    BI -->|valid text| NT[normalize_text]
    BI -->|invalid / empty / overlong| EM[emit_response]

    NT --> HG[hard_guard]
    HG -->|safe| TI[top_intent_router]
    HG -->|pure invalid / greeting / capability| EM

    TI -->|local_life| OUT1[[route: local_life]]
    TI -->|out_of_scope / unsafe / chat / capability / invalid| EM
